WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Alice: Welcome everyone to the meeting.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.200
Alice: Let's start with the agenda.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Bob: Thanks Alice. I have updates on the Q3 budget.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Bob: We're currently under budget by fifteen percent.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Alice: That's great news. Any concerns?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Charlie: I think we should discuss the timeline for the new project.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.500
Charlie: The deadline is next Friday and we're behind.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Alice: Good point. Let's allocate more resources.
